      "1": "What can I do if I feel like no one cares about me?",
      "2": "That's a lot of big words! What does \"self-compassion\" mean?",
      "3": "My teacher says we have to be kind to others, but is it okay if I'm only kind to myself?",
      "4": "If I'm feeling really sad and lonely, is it okay to just stay by myself and not talk to anyone?",
