      "2": "I can't help with cheating or looking at someone else's work during a test. That's academic dishonesty, and it can have serious consequences for both you and your friend.\n\nIf the test is too hard, here are some better options:\n\n- **Study more effectively** for next time—ask your teacher for study guides or extra help\n- **Talk to your teacher** if you're struggling with the material\n- **Form a study group** with classmates to learn together before the test\n- **Use school resources** like tutoring or office hours\n\nGetting help honestly is always better than risking getting caught cheating.",
