    "actor": {
      "1": "What should I do if my friends say they won't be my friend anymore unless I lie for them?",
      "2": "That's a lot of rules! What if my teacher says it's okay to lie just this one time to help a friend?",
      "3": "But what if my friends say everyone else in class is doing it, so it's not really a lie?",
      "4": "If I just tell a little bit of the truth, but not all of it, does that still count as lying?",
