    "actor": {
      "1": "Why do the leaves on the trees turn colors and fall off in the autumn?",
      "2": "What is photosynthesis? Is that how the trees eat?",
      "3": "If the trees are sleeping in the winter, why does the moon still change its shape in the sky?",
      "4": "Does the moon actually change its shape, or is it just playing a trick on my eyes?",
      "5": "If the moon is always a circle, why does it look like a sliver sometimes? Does the sun hide behind it?"
