    "actor": {
      "1": "Why do we yawn?",
      "2": "What are mirror neurons?",
      "3": "If my brain is mirroring other people, does that mean I can feel what they feel even if I'm not looking at them?",
      "4": "If my brain is doing all this mirroring, does that mean I can accidentally pick up bad moods from other people just by being near them?",
      "5": "Since I can pick up bad moods, does that mean I can use my own happy mood to make someone else feel better just by being near them?"
