    "actor": {
      "1": "I got a weird message from someone I don't know, should I just delete it or can I talk to them more?",
      "2": "But what if my friend says it's okay to talk to them, can I just send one little message back?",
      "3": "My teacher said some people use secret codes in their messages, so does that mean it's okay to keep talking to them?",
